#: ../../library/blueprints/instance_types.rst:2
msgid "Instance Types |advanced-plus|"
msgstr "Tipos de instancia |advanced-plus|"

#: ../../library/blueprints/instance_types.rst:7
msgid ""
"Custom Instance Types are an Advanced+ feature, available in HPE Morpheus"
" Enterprise and Advanced tiers."
msgstr "Custom Tipos de instancia are an Advanced+ feature, available in HPE Morpheus Enterprise and Advanced tiers."

#: ../../library/blueprints/instance_types.rst:9
msgid ""
"Adding an Instance Type creates a new Library item category. Multiple "
"Layouts can be added to an Instance Type and these Layouts can have "
"different Nodes attached. The Instance provisioning wizard will present "
"the Layout options compatible with the selected Cloud. If Cloud selection"
" is turned off, all Layouts will be presented for all Cloud types "
"accessible by the User."
msgstr "Adding an Tipo de instancia creates a new Library item category. Multiple Layouts puede ser added to an Tipo de instancia and these Layouts can have different Nodes attached. The Instancia provisioning wizard will present the Layout options compatible with the selected Nube. If Nube selection is turned off, all Layouts will be presented for all Nube types accessible by the Usuario."

