#: ../../library/blueprints/instance_types.rst:50
msgid "Price Sets"
msgstr "Price Sets"

#: ../../library/blueprints/instance_types.rst:41
msgid ""
"Associate a Price Set with the Instance Type, Price sets are created in "
"|AdmPlaSet|. Price Sets which are added to Instance Types become additive"
" with any pricing which may apply on the Service Plan. For example, a "
"\"fixed\" Price Set of $1000/month has been associated with the Instance "
"Type. If this Instance Type is provisioned to an Amazon AWS Cloud, the "
"additional fixed price would be computed along with any Price which is "
"pre-existing on the AWS Service Plan"
msgstr "Associate un/una Price Set con el/la Tipo de instancia, Price sets son creado/creada en |AdmPlaSet|. Price Sets el/la cual son agregado/agregada a Tipos de instancia become additive con cualquier pricing el/la cual puede/n apply en el/la Service Plan. For example, un/una \"fixed\" Price Set de $1000/month tiene been asociado/asociada con el/la Tipo de instancia. Si este/esta Tipo de instancia es provisioned a un/una Amazon AWS Nube, el/la additional fixed price would be computed along con cualquier Price el/la cual es pre-existing en el/la AWS Service Plan"

#: ../../library/blueprints/instance_types.rst:52
msgid "Environment Prefix"
msgstr "Environment Prefix"

#: ../../library/blueprints/instance_types.rst:53
msgid ""
"Used for exportable environment variables when tying Instance Types "
"together in App contexts. If not specified, a name will be generated"
msgstr "Used para exportable environment variables cuando tying Tipos de instancia together en App contexts. Si ningún specified, un/una name será/n be generated"

#: ../../library/blueprints/instance_types.rst:54
msgid "Environment Variables"
msgstr "Variables de entorno"

#: ../../library/blueprints/instance_types.rst:55
msgid ""
"Name and value pairs for environment variables to be loaded on "
"initialization"
msgstr "Name and value pairs for environment variables to be loaded on initialization"

#: ../../library/blueprints/instance_types.rst:56
msgid "Enable Settings"
msgstr "Habilitar configuración"

#: ../../library/blueprints/instance_types.rst:57
msgid ""
"Allows for attachment of modifiable file templates to Node Types in a "
"settings tab of the Instance after deployment"
msgstr "Allows para attachment de modifiable file templates a Tipos de nodo en un/una settings tab de el/la Instancia después de deployment"

#: ../../library/blueprints/instance_types.rst:58
msgid "Enable Scaling (Horizontal)"
msgstr "Habilitar escalado (horizontal)"

#: ../../library/blueprints/instance_types.rst:59
msgid "Enables load balancer assignment and auto-scaling features"
msgstr "Enables load balancer assignment and auto-scaling features"

#: ../../library/blueprints/instance_types.rst:61
msgid "Support Deployments"
msgstr "Soporte de despliegues"

#: ../../library/blueprints/instance_types.rst:61
msgid ""
"Enables deployment features (Requires a data volume be configured on each"
" version. Files will be copied into this location)"
msgstr "Enables deployment features (Requires un/una data volume be configurado/configurada en cada version. Files será/n be copied en este/esta location)"

#: ../../library/blueprints/instance_types.rst:63
msgid ""
"Upon saving, this Instance Type will be available in the provisioning "
"catalog, per User Role access. However, we still need to add Layouts to "
"the Instance Type, and prior to creating a Layout, we will add a Node "
"Type."
msgstr "Upon saving, este/esta Tipo de instancia será/n be disponible en el/la provisioning catalog, per Usuario Rol access. However, we still need a add Layouts a el/la Tipo de instancia, y prior a creating un/una Layout, we será/n add un/una Tipo de nodo."

